#: templates/admin/docs.php:78
msgid "<strong>Requirements:</strong> WordPress 6.2 or newer and PHP 7.4 or newer. Excel export also needs the PHP <code>ZipArchive</code> extension, which almost every host provides."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/docs.php:83
msgid "Open <strong>User Export → Export users</strong>. The wizard walks you through four steps; you can go back to any finished step from the step bar."
msgstr ""

