#: templates/admin/docs.php:236
msgid "<strong>Nginx users:</strong> Nginx ignores .htaccess files. File names are random so they cannot be guessed, but for full protection add a rule that denies access to <code>/wp-content/uploads/uempro-exports/</code>."
