#: templates/admin/docs.php:255
msgid "The export stops partway through."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/docs.php:256
msgid "Lower “Users per batch” in Settings (try 50) so each request does less work, and keep the browser tab open until the download starts."
msgstr ""

